partcad-repo-google-earth
=========================

This PartCAD package serves places in Google Earth as PartCAD parts.

The code in this repository (the `google_earth_repo.py` repository plugin, the
`earth.py` it reads Google with, the PartCAD configuration and the tests) is:

    Copyright 2026 PartCAD
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

No data of Google's is included in this repository, and none is kept by it.
Elevations, 3D tiles and geocoding results are fetched when a part is built,
with the Google Maps Platform API key of whoever builds it, and remain
Google's, under the Google Maps Platform Terms of Service
(https://cloud.google.com/maps-platform/terms) that key was issued under.

